```xml
<Nullable>enable</Nullable>
<WarningsAsErrors>nullable</WarningsAsErrors>
```

Now the build is dead — CS8602, CS8600 and CS8618 all over this controller and its view model. A colleague says just stick `!` on everything or put `#nullable disable` at the top of the file and move on, but I'd rather do it properly. Can you fix it up?

```csharp
public class ArticlePageViewModel
